Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.51,0:00:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The End. The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars\Nand reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow if we try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.31,0:00:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
