Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We share the good times!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, baby, baby,\Nalways share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to see for you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.78,0:00:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the darkness\Nthat is in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So hard to see or to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In where we need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.54,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you and me, it's true that we.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel the rush brought on by this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Through head to feet, I feel the beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.82,0:00:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting me to walk on, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times, take my hand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.30,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.78,0:01:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond, far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.24,0:01:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, as we chase, we're being chased.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,From the top we go, one straight and wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on our way. I've got to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I want to share your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now here it starts, so don't lose heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bound to lose to this flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From boot to hood, I feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be free to be, oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.48,0:01:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the music, even if I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the one dream, I know where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Share the good times,\Nshare the one world now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I look up to the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And reach for the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try no matter how high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.78,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.40,0:02:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Just on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.68,0:02:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.54,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it will be you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.96,0:02:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Always share the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.24,0:02:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, baby, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Always share the one world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what I can\Ndo when I go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.30,0:02:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now second gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me or is he steaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Men are kind of scary, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're nothing like us, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, boy, all your little\Ntrick has done is awaken our wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Medusa here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight-headed serpent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Sandusonia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She bit through the fence!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the snakes are\Njust made out of her hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.42,0:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,those fangs hit as hard as iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what he's going to do, but\Nsomehow I still can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,As you've clearly seen before, your\Nattacks simply bounce off of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.46,0:04:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonia, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I recall, you were supposed to kill\Nthe man, not indulge in his foolish games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:04:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,His transgressions are,\Nin a word, unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to tolerate him any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.92,0:05:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course we're very sorry, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.78,0:05:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll finish him immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.80,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Medusa here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.68,0:05:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't get bitten, he's\Ngonna get burned for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.98,0:05:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, this is my favorite attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Sonya!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.20,0:06:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is dragging me closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Our tail! How did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonia, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fooling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Sonia! Don't fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the pit of blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on to the stands!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.70,0:06:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder, Sonia, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.86,0:06:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to knock her\Ndown and skewer her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't winning enough you animal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to kick her\Nwhile she's down too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to mock me? Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you guys want to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean that I want to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why of all the insolent?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mary, this is your\Nchance to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.48,0:07:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He isn't mocking you, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That man is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.12,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Sandersonia's clothing\Nburned off in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Her back is showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If he gets off her, her\Ngorgon eyes will be exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, look away, she's going\Nto turn us all to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like your sister said before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.54,0:07:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What you saw is a secret we\Nwould die to protect Or rather,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,one that we would kill to protect\Nin this particular instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd rather die than let people\Nsee this thing on your back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I said, don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This match is hereby over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.16,0:08:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, you must\Nleave the arena at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not gaze upon the Gorgon eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that I was trying to\Nkill you just a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.98,0:08:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you protecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.22,0:08:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that mark on your back\Nhas nothing to do with our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We can always settle things later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly want to move\Nforward in this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You must come to terms with\Nwhat you wear on your back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us, Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We lost and were rescued by our enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what now you next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.42,0:09:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in the mood to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.60,0:09:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.34,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're gonna fix them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Make them normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.00,0:09:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You can make them normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like they did anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They just told the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.50,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.16,0:09:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I can easily reverse the\Neffects if I choose to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.54,0:10:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But, to be clear, didn't you say\Nyou wanted to go somewhere by ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gotta get back and find my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.24,0:10:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You must decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can either return them to normal,\Nor help you to reach your destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.56,0:10:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose one, forget the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm willing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we'll see your true nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.00,0:10:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good deal! That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, okay, go ahead and turn him back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That man,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.78,0:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he has such an immensely powerful Haki,\Nbut didn't hesitate to save those he owes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at Margaret. Sweet pea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh, Philandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering where you went.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,She reversed the petrification.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.70,0:10:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't believe it\Nwhen you defended that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.74,0:11:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us could.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.68,0:11:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you were turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was awful. Stone? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.45,0:11:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what happened to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Most peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.06,0:11:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no recollection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.86,0:11:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't remember a thing? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.18,0:11:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to, and the man,\Nwell, he seemed so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really freaking out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys were going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did everyone go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.40,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the trial over?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.42,0:11:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.54,0:11:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the first to have trouble\Nremembering after you've been turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry I'll catch you up on\Nthe details of what happened later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but what did happen and what\Ndid she do with the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You really need to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She just turned him to stone\Nand got on with her day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I could be mistaken, but it looked\Nlike they took him to Kuja Castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.24,0:11:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what'd you say you want from me? Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,please tell me you're\Ngonna serve up a big after
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Battle meal for us. So what's\Nthe best food around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I'm\Ngrateful. For what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. It was nothing. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me and we'll call it even.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone had seen what's on our backs,\Nit would have been the end of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.66,0:12:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be cast out, never to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You may enter. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.42,0:12:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, come inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.88,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.94,0:12:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind the curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got the food? Back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.34,0:12:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the food? And how\Ncome you took your clothes off?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My astute and charming, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,the mark on my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:12:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you said that\Nyou'd seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this mark means?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.50,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't pleasant, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the same, but it still\Nreminds me of the one I've seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.30,0:13:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fish man, and his name is Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a mark kind of like that one\Non his forehead, but it's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.06,0:13:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If he doesn't know what it is, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake Princess, be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.54,0:13:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You know you can trust him by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen with your\Nown eyes he's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your secret is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.64,0:14:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you're the notorious pirate\Nknown as Monkey D. Luffy, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.32,0:14:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know anything about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You do seem like a decent enough\Nyoung man, despite your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few days before he arrived, he caused\Nan incident on the Sabaody Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,An incident with dire repercussions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.60,0:14:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did he oppose the Celestial\NDragons, he punched one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,By some miracle,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,he was able to escape the Central\NForces they unleashed to capture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And just as miraculous,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.76,0:14:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,he traveled from that faraway\Nlocation to here in a few short days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of these things are\Nbeyond my comprehension.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.64,0:14:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:14:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I got flung here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't even know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.14,0:15:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.16,0:15:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't feel one bit bad about\Nknocking out that celestial dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that newspaper even mention\Nwhat that bastard did to my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.26,0:15:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that you\Nactually struck a celestial dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That there could be such a\Nwonderful fool left in this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.18,0:15:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To challenge the world nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.98,0:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,and risk your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.74,0:16:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I will tell you everything\Nthere is to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.88,0:16:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even tell you why your fishman friend\Nhas that emblem, and also what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, jeez, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This brand is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Claw of the Celestial Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Emblem of the World Nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The celestial dragons branded\Nupon those they take as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.80,0:16:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A marking to steal your humanity and claim
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you as their property and they marked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.02,0:16:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You see the three of\Nus were my sisters and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I we were once slaves of the world nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.52,0:16:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened when I was 12 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.48,0:17:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought a snack out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hancock! Sonia! Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.34,0:17:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us were abducted\Nfrom a Kuja pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In broad daylight, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we were sold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,From that point on, we were submitted\Nto a hell we can never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.68,0:17:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The first men we ever encountered were\Nnothing but figures of cruelty and horror.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonia, it'll be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.32,0:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories will always haunt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.30,0:17:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't put yourself through this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all so awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Our world was naught but despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And we prayed for the mercy of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.76,0:18:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But, after four years of that misery,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there came a night that shocked even\Nthe world government to its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.36,0:18:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was accepted as a rule\Nof the world that no one
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.38,0:18:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,would ever dare challenge\Nthe Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But on that fateful night,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.06,0:18:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a man who\Nscaled the red line with
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.50,0:18:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,his bare hands and slipped into Merijoie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the holy land of the Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This man was an adventurer who later\Nled the fishman pirates, Fisher Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He arrived with the sole\Npurpose of releasing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,his fellow fishmen who suffered as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He wreaked havoc on the\Nworld nobles without reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.72,0:18:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite his hatred for\Nhumans as a species!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He freed every one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:19:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,saving thousands of slaves\Nregardless of who or what they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.66,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And so we fled, more than\Nwilling to risk death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe an eternal debt to Fisher Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, tiger unleashed an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishmen swarmed the oceans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But they were cursed to wear the\Ncelestial dragon's mark of slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger was relentlessly hunted\Nby the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So he brought the fugitives together\Nto form the pirates of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And sailed far and wide across the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.60,0:19:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to erase the last\Ntrace of their bondage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The former slaves made a new brand\Nover the claw of the Celestial Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.60,0:19:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing them into a symbol of the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.68,0:19:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,By necessity, my brand bears\Na similarity in design.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you mistook it for the\Nsymbol of the sun pirates before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The mark on Hachi's forehead\Ndoes look like a sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, does that mean\NHachi used to be a slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Possibly, although not necessarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Not all of Tiger's pirates\Nwere former slaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but they were all branded with the\Nsymbol to hide their comrades past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.16,0:20:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,former slave or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.28,0:20:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it's safe to assume that your friend must
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,have sailed with the Sun\NPirates at some point?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger has been\Ndead for some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon his passing, the Sun Pirates\Ndisbanded and split into several factions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that wound on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.00,0:20:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you know the history of the Mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you can better\Nunderstand our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The things that they made us do as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They forced me to eat the love-love fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and forced my sisters to eat\Nsnake-snake fruits for their amusement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.24,0:21:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironically, this allowed us to\Nhide our secret from the Kuja.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.34,0:21:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They praise our powers because\Nthey misunderstand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you hadn't covered\NSandersonia's back in the arena,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the ugly truth would be apparent to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.72,0:21:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand for anyone\Nto know of our past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And I shall make any\Nsacrifice to ensure that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.22,0:21:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I must deceive my own people,\NI won't let anyone control us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear my own subjects I can't let anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,come close to me or they\Nmight know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, on the bright side of things,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been years since\Nyou've displayed even
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the most faint affectation of an emotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I welcome your tears as they prove our
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.08,0:22:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,sweet snake princess's\Nheart has not frozen over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who left this nation\Nbehind that's neither here nor there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.74,0:22:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,have you already forgotten where you\Nwould be without me yes you escaped the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.40,0:22:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,celestial dragons but you neglected\Nto mention that you didn't know how to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.06,0:22:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,get home tell me would you have seen\Namazon lily again if i hadn't gone to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.50,0:22:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the outer seas you would have starved\Nto death hiding in the cracks of the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,red line if it wasn't for me a small\Nkindness you'll never let us forget what
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say I've watched over the\Nthree of you as though you were my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Daughter, yes, I suppose you find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,repulsive now that you know i was a slave
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.68,0:22:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,really i told you i hate\Nthe celestial dragons
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.04,0:23:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,i've decided i like you you said\Nthat there was somewhere you needed
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,To go, yes. Well, my ship's at your
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.70,0:23:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,command name the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.02,0:23:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,place well it can
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.48,0:23:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,be any kind of boat as long as it\Nfloats we will set sail tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.70,0:23:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,morning the kuja pirates will get you\Nsafely to the Sabo odi archipelago
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,with our ship hope it's\Nno trouble rest well
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.64,0:23:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,tonight as i'm sure this\Nvisit has proved taxing
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.10,0:23:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll be out of here tomorrow morning
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! You can do it! It's like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.16,0:23:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.76,0:23:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:23:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.48,0:24:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the chopsticks from\Ntheir nose to their mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.70,0:24:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm holding baskets!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How shameful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.14,0:24:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they have no class at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.26,0:24:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to tell it to!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the specialty of Maiden Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Pinay Gorgonzola with\Nthe meat of a sea king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I really hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.60,0:24:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had sea king before,\Nbut this tastes different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it really does stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.30,0:24:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's soft and squishy like rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.34,0:24:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's up! Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.78,0:24:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just a little longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.50,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, bad enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You can eat it really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.38,0:24:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's hard to eat, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.78,0:24:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing? Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.46,0:24:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't eat with you\Npulling my face around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.30,0:24:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we can't help it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.60,0:24:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you're leaving tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people\Nhere who want to touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.72,0:24:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.20,0:24:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you're really popular!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.72,0:24:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.63,0:24:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.98,0:24:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just start a\Nbusiness behind my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.30,0:25:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Loopy, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.28,0:25:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight is the only chance\Nwe have to touch a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.06,0:25:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.62,0:25:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even you pushing\Nme around like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.82,0:25:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want food not touching!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.56,0:25:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did my freak go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.78,0:25:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where's the man?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.44,0:25:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He couldn't have gotten far. Move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.54,0:25:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find him and touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.04,0:25:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck's the matter with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.52,0:25:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This was all the food I could\Ngrab before I flew out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.82,0:25:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wonderful you'll be\Nwith your friends soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.10,0:25:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.48,0:25:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm sorry for all the\Ntrouble I started while I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.46,0:25:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I was real worried when\Nyou turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.20,0:25:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But then you protected\Nall of us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.78,0:25:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Back in the arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.76,0:25:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.20,0:25:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.38,0:25:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.12,0:26:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Nyon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.08,0:26:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Parker, is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.70,0:26:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but the villagers\Nwouldn't stop touching Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.34,0:26:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So I brought him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.52,0:26:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well it's not every\Nday they see a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.68,0:26:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Granny Bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.34,0:26:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's welcome to stay here\Nuntil things die down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.64,0:26:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And my name's not Bean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.40,0:26:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he has plenty to eat already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.12,0:26:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just bring him some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.38,0:26:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.52,0:26:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Granny, you like reading newspapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.28,0:26:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The cool news isn't delivered anywhere\Ninside of a comm belt, so it's hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are certain perks when your\Nempress is one of the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.38,0:26:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with our isolation, I like\Nknowing what's going on in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.56,0:26:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.26,0:26:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.58,0:26:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's one of the warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.10,0:26:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So does that mean she's\Nactually super strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.16,0:26:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pirate, surely you\Nknow who all the warlords are?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.92,0:26:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he thinks so, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.44,0:27:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, don't you ever read a newspaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.50,0:27:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, I sure don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.12,0:27:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.46,0:27:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Snake Princess was\Ncrowned ruler of this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.92,0:27:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and she was also named the captain of\Nthe Kuja Pirates around 11 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.26,0:27:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She was still young and inexperienced,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but the world government put a bounty\Nof 80 million berries on her head?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.46,0:27:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,after just one expedition.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.32,0:27:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.56,0:27:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kaido pirates were notorious\Nbefore she became a captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.44,0:27:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, the world government took\Nan interest in her right from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.08,0:27:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,which led to their decision to\Ninvite her to become a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.68,0:27:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But now her title is about to be revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.86,0:27:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you don't read the papers,\Nperhaps you haven't heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.66,0:27:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.04,0:27:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The warlords are teaming\Nup with the Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.46,0:27:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're going to have a war\Nwith Whitebeard and his crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.60,0:27:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.02,0:28:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This, this is way too much\Nfor me to take in all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.32,0:28:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What a foolish man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.16,0:28:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know anything, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, listen, that was only\Nconjecture at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.10,0:28:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any proof, but I'd say\Nthat battle is a high probability.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.62,0:28:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The world government\Nhas laid out their bait,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.50,0:28:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But Captain Whitebeard would\Nnever ever allow his mates
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.12,0:28:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To be killed. But even with\Nthat knowledge, they have
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.34,0:28:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Announced the public\Nexecution of Port Royal Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.80,0:28:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,powerful and high-ranking\Ncommander in his crew Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.18,0:28:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A .K .A.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.28,0:28:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Firefist Ace
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.84,0:28:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna execute.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.62,0:28:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,According to this, a pirate\Nnamed Blackbeard defeated Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.38,0:28:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and gave him up to the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.46,0:28:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,In return, they invited\Nhim to be a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.20,0:28:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.72,0:28:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This sends a strong message.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.64,0:29:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The government has\Ncaught a big fish indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.10,0:29:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than that,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.01,0:29:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,if this show of authority can prove that\Nthey're stronger than Whitebeard himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.52,0:29:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.43,0:29:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.58,0:29:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.88,0:29:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Por Castle, the Fire Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.08,0:29:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.94,0:29:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.85,0:29:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My word! I never knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.92,0:29:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I didn't know\Nanything about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.16,0:29:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.44,0:29:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But he can still escape, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.82,0:29:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd say that his best chance would\Nbe if Whitebeard takes the bait and wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.60,0:29:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, does it say where\Nthey're gonna execute him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.56,0:29:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the town square of Marineford,\Nwhere Navy Headquarters is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.98,0:29:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It says the execution will\Ntake place in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.18,0:29:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's six days from today
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.76,0:29:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will it take to get\Nfrom here back to Sabo Odi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.14,0:29:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at top speed, it would\Ntake more than a week!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.46,0:29:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A week!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.37,0:30:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That means by the time\NI meet up with my crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.26,0:30:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.56,0:30:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.86,0:30:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, how long to get to where\NAce is, if he's being held at?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.36,0:30:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Impel down that would take I\Nwould say a week on a pirate ship
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.58,0:30:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps four days on a\NNavy ship. Whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.58,0:30:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when are Navy ships that fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.62,0:30:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a sea current that's reserved\Nexclusively for the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.12,0:30:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,From Inni's lobby, to Impel Down,\Nto Navy headquarters and back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it as a giant whirlpool\Nthat connects those three facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.90,0:30:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When the Gates of Justice are\Nopened at any of these locales,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.72,0:30:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,usually to a Navy vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.38,0:30:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the current from the whirlpool\Nchanges and ships are ushered inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.60,0:30:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if the gates aren't opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.54,0:30:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the ship would keep following the\Nnatural flow of the whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.26,0:30:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.18,0:30:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,most pirate ships would rather skip this\Ncurrent altogether and go the long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.82,0:30:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's convenient for the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.60,0:30:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.46,0:31:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.40,0:31:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.64,0:31:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your brother's beaver card?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, is that the moving paper\Nthat you care so much about?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.40,0:31:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh, that one was a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.60,0:31:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the card that Ace gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're also known as the paper of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.40,0:31:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,since they give you a hint about\Nthe person's state of health?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.48,0:31:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as their direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, if it's that small, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.78,0:31:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when he first gave it to\Nme, it was ten times bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.14,0:31:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Ace has been busy on his own
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.94,0:31:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.85,0:31:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly natural for a guy\Nto worry about his bungling kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.06,0:31:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.97,0:31:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace wouldn't be happy about\Nhis little brother saving him,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.90,0:31:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's still better than him dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.80,0:32:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm gonna need\Nto take a little side trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.20,0:32:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.20,0:32:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.44,0:32:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the only brother I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.06,0:32:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should think this through.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.38,0:32:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how\Nreckless this plan is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.88,0:32:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're facing a full-fledged war.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.58,0:32:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be nothing more than a\Nleaf whipped about by a storm,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.20,0:32:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,an insect flicked away by hands\Nfar mightier than your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.20,0:32:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.08,0:32:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I still gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.72,0:32:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't live with myself\Nif I let this happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.52,0:32:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.52,0:32:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, you plan to rescue the\Nmost infamous prisoner in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.66,0:32:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you a one in a\Nmillion chance of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.72,0:32:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But in order to even try, you need to get\Nto the great prison where he's being held.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.30,0:32:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they transport him to Marineford,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.88,0:33:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,both the admirals and the warlords will\Nbe keeping a close eye on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.20,0:33:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.28,0:33:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your brother is the most\Nimportant prisoner in the Navy's custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the prison will be carefully guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.60,0:33:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and it has quite the fearsome\Nreputation if you haven't heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.16,0:33:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It may prove impossible\Nto enter no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.48,0:33:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll worry about that when I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.60,0:33:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.92,0:33:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta make it before they\Ntake Ace to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.70,0:33:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the biggest door you've\Ngot, and I'll paddle like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.90,0:33:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never reach the prison\Nby determination alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.16,0:33:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a slim chance this could work,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.90,0:33:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But the snake princess is\Nrefusing to follow the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.60,0:33:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,the seven warlords to assemble\NBut what if that changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.08,0:33:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If she obeyed that order,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.94,0:33:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we could take advantage of the situation\Nand sneak you on board their ship Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.54,0:33:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.45,0:33:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean there's a navy ship here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.50,0:33:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, then I'm gonna go\Nask her if she'll do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.04,0:34:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Greninion, it's terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.28,0:34:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Inishida, what's all the fuss about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.48,0:34:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness I found you quickly\Nwhen I heard I came as fast as I could
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.34,0:34:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.94,0:34:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.50,0:34:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The snake princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.02,0:34:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's come down with a sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.66,0:34:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one knows what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.52,0:34:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.43,0:34:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She's sick! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.72,0:34:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, fight it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.50,0:34:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.41,0:34:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.96,0:34:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about the\Nsnake princess falling ill?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.56,0:34:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Couran and Yon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.62,0:34:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I need you to wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.22,0:34:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.50,0:34:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry! I knew that!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.52,0:35:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.36,0:35:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She keeps clutching her chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.56,0:35:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps something is wrong with her heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.82,0:35:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Since her symptoms are a mystery,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.62,0:35:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,there's very little I can\Ndo in terms of treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.42,0:35:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is that\Nit's extremely painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.08,0:35:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She won't eat a thing and\Nshe's hardly speaking either.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.98,0:35:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.56,0:35:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.02,0:35:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is, Granny\NNyon, you've got to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.36,0:35:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course. That fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.52,0:35:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have realized.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.28,0:35:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pity that the virus came\Nat a time like this. Huh? Virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.68,0:35:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know what it is, then just tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.12,0:35:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe, Granny Magellan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I going to die like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.98,0:36:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.00,0:36:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll say it isn't so.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is supposed to be\Na joke, we're not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.44,0:36:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It has killed us before.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.76,0:36:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It took the life of our last Empress.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The same fate befell the\NEmpress before her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.58,0:36:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I suffered from the illness myself, but\Nleft the country before it took my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.42,0:36:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No remedy could save me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake princess. Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.76,0:36:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy has come to see you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.76,0:36:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is hardly the time He\Nhas a request to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.04,0:36:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean request?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.64,0:36:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see she's suffering?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.10,0:36:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How important could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.70,0:36:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened? Show him in quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.98,0:36:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.40,0:36:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you are a man favored by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.10,0:36:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this mountain\Ncan be moved after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.96,0:36:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And perhaps you are the one to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.90,0:37:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you need something.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.68,0:37:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.36,0:37:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.60,0:37:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.02,0:37:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.10,0:37:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No illness can overtake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.08,0:37:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a pirate on\NWhitebeard's crew named Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.40,0:37:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my brother, and he's\Nabout to be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.06,0:37:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go rescue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.02,0:37:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I heard if we took a\Npirate ship, it'd be too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.96,0:37:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So instead of going back to my friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.28,0:37:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to get on a Navy\Nship and take me with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.76,0:37:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you even suggest\Nthat, you selfish beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.38,0:37:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know full well the\Nhorrors our poor sister went
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.98,0:37:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,through and steal you a dragger\Nto that abhorrent prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.50,0:37:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.22,0:37:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is exactly why we hate men.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.12,0:37:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We very well could have killed you,\Nbut as soon as we show you mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.32,0:37:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,then you let it go to your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.76,0:37:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky she doesn't turn\Nyou to stone and smash you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.24,0:37:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to follow the government's\Norders and go with the other warlords?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.24,0:37:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's said enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.52,0:37:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.84,0:38:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If that is truly your request, then of\Ncourse, I will go anywhere you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, thanks. I was worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.30,0:38:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I would\Nhave done without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.70,0:38:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She actually said yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.58,0:38:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't listen to reason,\Nbut she'll listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to her, Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.62,0:38:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Like the Empress before her,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.30,0:38:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,our Empress succumbed to the burning\Nflames that are known only as love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.18,0:38:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a saying in the East Blue\Nthat describes these winds of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.70,0:38:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.50,0:38:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Always... A...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.58,0:38:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on!
